  "description": "The Horizon Tour 20 Wave combines a low step-through design with dependable performance for easy everyday mobility. LED lighting improves your visibility in busy areas, while the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility supports commuting, shopping or family use.\n\nIts belt-drive with internal gear hub keeps operation smooth and maintenance low. Comfort is enhanced with an adjustable stem, while SP Connect lets you easily mount your smartphone for daily rides. With a 100mm suspension fork, the Horizon Tour 20 Wave handles uneven streets comfortably. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires offer strong puncture protection and secure traction for daily urban riding.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line motor provides steady support, and the 540Wh PowerTube battery can be removed for convenient charging. With Bosch PowerMore battery compatibility and connectivity functions via the Bosch eBike Flow App, this e-bike is a versatile partner for city rides and weekend excursions.",
